WEBVTT

00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:32.069
I'm gripped with chills in my spine
as I run after her in terror.

00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:35.665
She puts the baby on a bench

00:00:35.689 --> 00:00:38.340
and begins a resuscitation procedure.

00:00:39.285 --> 00:00:40.998
Thirty minutes later,

00:00:41.022 --> 00:00:42.385
she tells me,

00:00:43.188 --> 00:00:44.733
"Don't worry,

00:00:44.757 --> 00:00:46.539
he will be fine,

00:00:46.563 --> 00:00:49.100
and thank you for staying calm."

00:00:49.711 --> 00:00:51.656
He was placed in the ICU,

00:00:52.865 --> 00:00:55.179
and though I cannot touch him,

00:00:55.203 --> 00:00:57.061
I repeatedly say,

00:00:57.085 --> 00:00:58.909
"Shine on, my son.

00:00:59.846 --> 00:01:01.068
Don't give up.